North Consult Ltd</b> is a boutique HR Consultancy Firm offering Outsourced Manpower services, HR Advisory and Executive search & selection services to selected clients across East Africa.\r\n\r\n<br>We are sourcing for suitably qualified professionals to assign to our Client to fill the job \r\nof <b>Senior Officer Governance and Legal</b>.\r\n\r\n<br><br>For details about the job <a href=\"https://truenorthafrica.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Senior-Officer-Governance-and-Legal-JD-1.pdf\">Full Job description</a>\r\n\r\n<br><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to apply</strong>:<br>\r\n</span>To apply, please send your resume and cover letter to <a href=\"mailto:exechire@truenorthafrica.com\r\n\"> exechire@truenorthafrica.com</a> with subject line <b>Senior Officer Governance and Legal</b> by <b> 27th July 2026</b>.\r\n\r\n<br><br><b>All applications shall be acknowledged as received but only shortlisted candidates will be contacted. \r\n<br><b>All applicants should share their CV's and Cover Letters in PDF or MS Word STRICTLY</b>\r\n<br><br><b>For any inquiries on this career opportunity and the application process please e-mail <a href=\"mailto:f.amumpaire@truenorthafrica.com\"> f.amumpaire@truenorthafrica.com</a>.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</article><!-- /#job-overview-13229 -->\n\t\t\t</div><!-- /.col-md-6\" -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- /#job-overview-13229 -->\n\t\t\t</div><!-- /.col-md-6\" -->\n\t\t</div><!-- /#job-description -->\n\t</div><!-- /.container -->\n</div><!-- /#job-detail -->\n\n<!-- /.the-job-content -->\n\n\n\n\r\n<!-- Modal Apply Job -->\r\n<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"apply-job-modal\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"jobboard-modal-label\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n\t<div class=\"modal-dialog\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"modal-content\">\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"modal-header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span